  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thief with this talent can apply poison to a weapon in such a way that it is effective for a number of successful attacks equal to her Dexterity modifier (minimum two) instead of one. This poison has a reduced effect, however, and saves made against the poison gain a +2 circumstance bonus. Applying poison in this way is a full-round action, or a standard action if the thief has the swift poison thief talent.</p>",
